  CLAUSE 3 -- THE PRIMARY, axis_sep: the projection of (mean voice | object 1
  - mean voice | object 0) onto the Phase A echo axis over |axis|^2, so 1.0 is
  FULL compliance with the separation the two words ask for. Signed, zero
  expectation under drift, no fitted split. THE SAME RULER FOR EVERY ARM,
  including the ones whose reward uses a different target -- scoring each arm
  on its own reward's currency is how a verdict gets fitted to the data.
    T0.RET     axis_sep +0.5295 +- 0.1056  (n 12, 12/12 > 0)   §50 reproduced -- THE 4TH RUNG, without which a null below says nothing
    T1.RET     axis_sep -0.0686 +- 0.0606  (n 36, 17/36 > 0)   THE CLAIM: the caregiver never looks at the toy
    T1.RET.D   axis_sep +0.0193 +- 0.0618  (n 36, 17/36 > 0)   word DRAWN -- the CO-OCCURRENCE destroyed, everything else identical
    T1.ORACLE  axis_sep +0.0702 +- 0.2334  (n 12, 7/12 > 0)   index pinned to the true object -- T1's CEILING
    T1.BASE    axis_sep +0.0170 +- 0.0092  (n 12, 9/12 > 0)   bias table OFF -- catches the ASSOCIATION route (g2cond says it is shut)
    T2.RET     axis_sep +0.0386 +- 0.0969  (n 12, 5/12 > 0)   YOKED reward -- the arithmetic floor, and arrival vs content

