  CLAUSE 5 -- THE VERDICT. Paired by creature, bar 2 SE, sign unconstrained.
    T1.RET - T1.RET.D   -0.0879  (paired SE 0.0741, -1.2 SE)   <-- PRIMARY
    T1.RET - T2.RET     +0.0338  (paired SE 0.1018)
    T1.RET - T1.BASE    +0.0554  (paired SE 0.0665)
    in these units 1.0 is FULL compliance, so 2 SE = 0.1482 is the smallest
    share of the asked-for gesture this run can resolve.

    (5) THE TEACHER IS THE BLOCKER, NOT THE INDEX. T1.ORACLE reads +0.0702
    +- 0.2334 with a PERFECT index, and T1.RET -0.0686. A teacher whose target
    lives in the world rather than in this creature's motor space cannot
    teach this mapping however good the index is. §50's scope limit 1 is a
    real wall; vocallearn's conclusion survives the index being supplied;
    and the next lead is the TEACHER, not the retina. T0 on the same run
    reads +0.5295, so the protocol is teaching -- it is this teacher that is
    not.

  *** READ EVERY BRANCH ABOVE AGAINST CLAUSE 0's DOSE REFUSAL. An arm that
  fired at under half of T0's rate was not tested at the dose its name
